  "title": {
   "en": "Kimi Wo Hitori Ni Shite Agenai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "君をひとりにしてあげない"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "*\"I won't let you be alone.\"*\n\nChigusa, who struggles to express herself, ends up building walls between herself and other people. She's always alone at school, until one day a stunningly beautiful boy transfers to her school. To Chigusa's surprise, the boy turns out to be Iroha, the only person she ever considered a friend in her childhood. Iroha tells her that he changed schools just to see her. He effortlessly crosses the walls Chigusa has built around her, steadily closing the distance between them.\n\n(Source: Kodansha, translated)",
   "ja": "「僕が独りぼっちにさせないから」 言葉足らずによって、人と壁を作ってしまう千草（ちぐさ）。 いつも学校で独りでいると、ある日美しい男子と噂の転校生がくることに。 それは、小さい頃に唯一友達と思えた彩巴（いろは）で、千草に会うために転校してきたと言い出して…！？ 千草の壁を彩巴だけはひょいと超えて、ぐいぐい距離を詰めてきてーー。 愛が重い執着系男子×独りぼっち女子の偏愛物語！"
  },
